  "title": "Ultra-fast charging at the Energie Steiermark headquarters",
  "summary": "With two ultra-fast charging columns directly in front of the main entrance to the company headquarters in Graz, Energie Steiermark is reaffirming its claim to leadership in the field of e-mobility: with up to 320 kilowatts, the system charges electric cars of customers, visitors and employees in a matter of minutes. Installation is possible at normal grid connections and is therefore inexpensive, unbureaucratic and even possible in residential areas.",
